---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import TopicLayout from "../../layouts/TopicLayout.astro";
import firstForemost from "../../assets/topics/First_formost.jpg";
---

<TopicLayout slug="heaven">
  <p class="bubble">
    <b
      >"There is a river whose streams make glad the city of God, the holy place
      where the Most High dwells." - Psalms 46:4</b
    >
  </p>

  <p class="warning-box">
    <span class="warning-icon">⚠️</span>
    <span class="warning-text">
      <b>
        Before you move on to read about the beauty, healing and glories of
        heaven, you must understand that heaven <u>is not</u> for <u>everyone</u
        >. If you have not rsvped to the invitation God has proclaimed don't
        expect a place to be reserved for you.
        <br /><br />
        If you have not received an invitation yet or would like to be informed on
        how to rsvp
        <a href="/topics/invitation/"> Click Here</a>
      </b>
    </span>
    <span class="warning-icon">⚠️</span>
  </p>

  <div class="bubble2">
    <p><b>Heaven:</b></p>
    <p>
      A Christian's eternal home with Christ. To a Christian who truly knows
      their King, nothing could sound more sweet.
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
      "Lord, you alone are my portion and my cup; you make my lot secure. The
      boundary lines have fallen for me in pleasant places; surely I have a
      delightful inheritance. You make known to me the path of life; you will
      fill me with joy in your presence, with eternal pleasures at your right
      hand." - Psalms 16:5-6,11
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="heaven-subtopics" aria-label="Heaven topics">
    <div class="heaven-subtopic-grid">
      <a href="/topics/heaven/first-and-foremost/" class="heaven-subtopic-card heaven-subtopic-card-featured" data-astro-prefetch>
        <Image src={firstForemost} alt="First and Foremost" class="heaven-subtopic-image" widths={[400, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 92vw, 33vw" />
        <span class="heaven-subtopic-number">01</span>
        <h3>First and Foremost</h3>
      </a>
      <a href="/topics/heaven/imagine/" class="heaven-subtopic-card" data-astro-prefetch>
        <span class="heaven-subtopic-number">02</span>
        <h3>I can only imagine....so imagine</h3>
      </a>
      <a href="/topics/heaven/kingdom/" class="heaven-subtopic-card" data-astro-prefetch>
        <span class="heaven-subtopic-number">03</span>
        <h3>Heaven, A world, A country, A Kingdom, A city prepared</h3>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="scripture-credit">
    Scripture taken from the Holy Bible, NEW INTERNATIONAL VERSION&reg;,
    NIV&reg; Copyright &copy; 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.&reg; Used
    by permission. All rights reserved worldwide.
  </p>
</TopicLayout>

<style>
  .heaven-subtopics {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card {
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card-featured {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card-featured::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0.16), rgb(0 0 0 / 0.68));
    content: '';
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-number {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card h3 {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .heaven-subtopic-card-featured .heaven-subtopic-number,
  .heaven-subtopic-card-featured h3 {
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .heaven-subtopic-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

  }
</style>
